n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"347\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b> 14/11/2025</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>11/12/2025</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>11/12/2025</b></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<strong>10-11 January 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam City Available : <strong>26/12/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available :<strong>08/01/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available: <strong>31/01/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Tier I Result Available : <strong>28/02/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Tier II Exam Date : <strong>27-31 March 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam City Available : <strong>10/03/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Tier II Admit Card Available : <strong>23/03/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available: <strong>13/05/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Tier II Result Available : <strong>17/08/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"273\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>For Assistant Commissioner / Principal / Vice Principal Post : </strong></li>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>2800/-</b></li>\n<li><strong>For Sr / Jr Secretariat Assistant / Stenographer / JSA / Lab Attendant / MTS Post :</strong></li>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>1700/-</b></li>\n<li><strong>For PGT / TGT / PRT &amp; Other Post :</strong></li>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>2000/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <strong>500</strong><b>/- (All Post)</b></li>\n<li>PH (Divyang) : <strong>500</strong><b>/- (All Post)</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Cast at E Challan or Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking<b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>CBSE KVS / NVS Teaching and Non Teaching Notification 2025 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Age Limit</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age :<strong> 18 Years (All Post)</strong></li>\n<li>Primary Teacher : <strong>Max 30 Years</strong></li>\n<li>TGT Teacher :<strong> Max 35 Years </strong></li>\n<li>PGT Teacher : <strong>Max 40 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Vice Principal : <strong>35-45 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Principal : <strong>35-50 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Assistant Commissioner : <strong>Max 50 Years </strong></li>\n<li>Non Teaching Post : <strong>Post Wise</strong></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per CBSE KVS / NVS Teaching and Non Teaching Recruitment Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>CBSE KVS / NVS Teaching and Non Teaching Recruitment 2025: <span style=\"color: #008000\">Vacancy Details </span></b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Total : 15762 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>CBSE KVS / NVS Teaching and Non Teaching Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangatha (KVS) Various Post</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">9921 Post</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Post Wise Eligibility</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Navodaya Vidyalay Samiti (NVS) Various Post</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">5841 Post</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Post Wise Eligibility</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>How to Fill CBSE KVS / NVS Teaching and Non Teaching Recruitment Online Form 2025</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>CBSE KVS / NVS Teaching and Non Teaching Recruitment for Various Post Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>14/11/2025 to 11/12/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in CBSE KVS / NVS Teaching and Non Teaching Recruitment 2025.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\"><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n<p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full CBSE KVS / NVS Teaching and Non Teaching Exam 2025 Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"292\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Interview Letter</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a titl